      <label>Just talk ${Q("voiceMode",!!n.voiceMode)} <span class="muted">\u201Chello\u201D = the tutor comes \xB7 \u201CI know\u201D \xB7 \u201Cbye bye\u201D = the tutor goes, the video plays</span></label>
